      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "## Download Power Monitoring Data\n\nThis dashboard exports the raw Power Monitoring data for all machines.\n\n1. Select the required timeframe using the time selector in the top-right corner.\n2. Hover over the table below and click the three dots in the top-right corner.\n3. Select `Inspect` and then `Data`.\n4. Open `Data options` and enable `Apply panel transformations` if available.\n5. Click `Download CSV`.\n\n> All machines are included in the same dataset. `Machine` identifies the power monitor, `Phase` identifies the phase where applicable, `Variable` identifies the measurement variable, and `Value` contains the stored value.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.1.3",
      "title": "CSV Data Export",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "influxdb"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            },
            "inspect": false
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 18,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "countRows": false,
          "fields": "",
          "reducer": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "show": false
        },
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.1.3",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "influxdb",
            "uid": "influxdb"
          },
          "hide": false,
          "query": "from(bucket: \"${const_bucket}\")\n  |> range(start: v.timeRangeStart, stop: v.timeRangeStop)\n  |> filter(fn: (r) =>\n      r[\"_measurement\"] == \"equipment_power_usage\" or\n      r[\"_measurement\"] == \"energy\"\n  )\n  |> map(fn: (r) => ({\n      r with\n      phase: if exists r.phase then r.phase else \"N/A\"\n  }))\n  |> keep(columns: [\n      \"_time\",\n      \"machine\",\n      \"phase\",\n      \"_measurement\",\n      \"_field\",\n      \"_value\"\n  ])\n  |> group()\n  |> sort(columns: [\n      \"_time\",\n      \"machine\",\n      \"phase\",\n      \"_measurement\",\n      \"_field\"\n  ])\n  |> rename(columns: {\n      _time: \"Time\",\n      machine: \"Machine\",\n      phase: \"Phase\",\n      _measurement: \"Measurement\",\n      _field: \"Variable\",\n      _value: \"Value\"\n  })",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Power Monitoring Data - All Machines",
      "transformations": [],
      "type": "table"
    }
